          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumichorizons.tut_addon_thaumichorizons.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "神秘视界是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumichorizons:tut_addon_thaumichorizons/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumichorizons.tut_addon_thaumichorizons.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "神秘视界的主题是"
                },
                {
                  "text": "生物神秘学",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "：建造注魔缸，给动物甚至你自己注魔，获得水下呼吸、攀墙等能力。此外还有炼金栽培、奥术透镜、新的法杖核心，以及最终通往口袋异次元的异界研究。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumichorizons:tut_addon_thaumichorizons/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumichorizons:tut_addon_thaumichorizons/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumichorizons.tut_addon_thaumichorizons.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "从哪里开始\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumichorizons:tut_addon_thaumichorizons/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumichorizons.tut_addon_thaumichorizons.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "alcheponics"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：炼金栽培，无需前置。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "lensFire"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：奥术透镜，戴在护目镜上的功能镜片。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "infusionVat"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：生物注魔，核心设备注魔缸。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "selfInfusion"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：自我注魔，给自己附加能力。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "planarTheory"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：异界理论，后期路线（需要虚空金属）。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
